---
title: Tomato Basil Bread
description: A flavourful bread machine loaf with sun-dried tomatoes, fresh basil, and garlic. Rich, savoury, and easy to make.
source: https://cody-swithenbank.notion.site/Tomato-Basil-Bread-325d07a2b8818096b053c886cf5471b7
servings: 1 loaf
tags: bread, baking, bread-machine, italian-inspired, vegetarian
---

Add the following ingredients to the #bread machine{} in this exact order: @water{1%cup}, @tomato paste{3%tbsp}, @oil from sun-dried tomatoes{1%tbsp}, @sun-dried tomatoes{2%tbsp}(chopped), @sea salt{1%tsp}, @sugar{1%tbsp}, @garlic powder{1/4%tsp}, @dried minced onion{2%tsp}, @fresh basil{1/4%cup}(chopped), @bread flour{3%cups}, then @active dry yeast{1%container} last.

Close the lid and run on a standard bread cycle.
